{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04225","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋蝉 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九秋行已暮，一枝聊暂安。\n隐榆非谏楚，噪柳异悲潘。\n分形妆薄鬓，镂影饰危冠。\n自怜疎影断，寒林夕吹寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}